# backlog-real-ledger joins two validators against the classifier on THIS repository's real ledger.
# The three scripts are copied into each probe tree and run; the two reconcile files are loaded
# beside them. docs/backlog.md carries `+`: it sits under an excluded top, and `+` keys it anyway,
# in the hook's per-fixture key and in scripts/suite-content-key.sh's outer key.
!scripts/validate-backlog-receipts.sh
!scripts/validate-backlog-size.sh
!scripts/backlog-reverify.sh
core/skills/ai-dlc-update/reconcile/lib.sh
core/skills/ai-dlc-update/reconcile/ledger-reverify.sh
+docs/backlog.md
core/skills/ai-dlc-update/reconcile/consumer-read.sh
